; ROTOR RAIDER - game over. A slow lament, E minor, 4 bars.
#title Game Over
#tempo 84
#grid 4
#inst lead pulse25 vol=44 decay=1
#inst bass triangle vol=50
#inst kick kick vol=50
A @lead
A o4 b2 a4 g4 | o4 f+2 e4 d4 | o4 e4 g4 f+4 d+4 | o4 e1
B @bass l2
B o2 e o2 c | o2 d o2 b | o2 c o2 b | o2 e o2 e
D l4 o4
D @kick c r r r | @kick c r r r | @kick c r @kick c r | @kick c r r r
